{
  "file_id": "3556",
  "text_count": 115,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "��������All right, let's hurry to the\ngate!",
      "_offset": 5773,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "_offset": 5817,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "Enlistment Conscription",
      "_offset": 5823,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "...Can those Digimon even read\nthis?",
      "_offset": 5847,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Come on, Taichi! Lay out the\ncards!",
      "_offset": 5884,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "Huh? Are you sure you want me to\ndo it?",
      "_offset": 5920,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "I'll leave this to you, Taichi!",
      "_offset": 5960,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "W-what's this all of a sudden?",
      "_offset": 5992,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "I'm not just trying to shove all\nthe responsibility onto you. I\nreally believe in you!",
      "_offset": 6023,
      "_length": 86,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Huuuuuuuuuh?!",
      "_offset": 6110,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 7,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Me, too! At a time like this, we\nshould be following the leader!",
      "_offset": 6124,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Hey, hey! When did I become the\nleader?",
      "_offset": 6189,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "The group fell apart the moment\nyou disappeared!",
      "_offset": 6229,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "And you're the one who brought us\nall together again!",
      "_offset": 6278,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 6,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "Well, I don't care about that!",
      "_offset": 6332,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 8,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Mimi...",
      "_offset": 6363,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Get me home! Do whatever you can!",
      "_offset": 6371,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 23,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "..that's what I'd have said back \nthen, but I'm not gonna say \nselfish things like that anymore!",
      "_offset": 6405,
      "_length": 96,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "You're right. If we don't change\nourselves, nothing else will\nchange.",
      "_offset": 6502,
      "_length": 69,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "I'll believe in my friends!",
      "_offset": 6572,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Guys...",
      "_offset": 6600,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Don't you agree, Takeru?",
      "_offset": 6608,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Yeah! We'll still be together even\nif we end up in the wrong world,\nright?",
      "_offset": 6633,
      "_length": 74,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "I'm not scared at all!",
      "_offset": 6708,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "Yeah...",
      "_offset": 6731,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "What about you, Koushirou?",
      "_offset": 6739,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "Ah, yes. As always, I believe in\nTaichi.",
      "_offset": 6766,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "Do it, Taichi!",
      "_offset": 6807,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "...Okay.",
      "_offset": 6822,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "Hm?! This is...",
      "_offset": 6831,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 18,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "What's wrong?",
      "_offset": 6847,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "There's something written in the\narea where you put the cards.",
      "_offset": 6861,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 18,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "It must be a hint about what cards\nto choose!",
      "_offset": 6924,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "They're the same characters we've \nseen elsewhere in this world. I'll \ntranslate them with my computer.",
      "_offset": 6970,
      "_length": 103,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "Okay, I'll leave it to you!",
      "_offset": 7074,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "Here's the first sentence.",
      "_offset": 7102,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "\"From the Virus-types, present a\nChild form.\"",
      "_offset": 7129,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "A Child form from the\nVirus-types... um...",
      "_offset": 7175,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 18,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "It's Kuwagamon!",
      "_offset": 7218,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "It's Gazimon!",
      "_offset": 7234,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "It's TonosamaGekomon!",
      "_offset": 7248,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Next one, Koushirou.",
      "_offset": 7270,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Yes. Here's the second hint.",
      "_offset": 7291,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "\"From the Data-types, present an\nAdult form.\"",
      "_offset": 7320,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "An Adult form from the Data-types,\nthat's...",
      "_offset": 7366,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 18,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "It's Unimon!",
      "_offset": 7411,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "It's Digitamamon!",
      "_offset": 7424,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "It's Drimogemon!",
      "_offset": 7442,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "That brings us to the third\nsentence.",
      "_offset": 7459,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "\"From the Vaccine-types, present a\nPerfect form.\"",
      "_offset": 7497,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "A Perfect form from the\nVaccine-types, that's...",
      "_offset": 7547,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 18,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "It's Unimon!",
      "_offset": 7596,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "It's Digitamamon!",
      "_offset": 7609,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "It's Andromon!",
      "_offset": 7627,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "Got it! Koushirou, the last hint.",
      "_offset": 7642,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "It's still translating. Just a\nlittle longer...",
      "_offset": 7676,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "I won't let you do that!",
      "_offset": 7724,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "What's that?",
      "_offset": 7752,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 6,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "I won't let you intrude in Lord\nVamdemon's castle!",
      "_offset": 7765,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "Aaaaaaaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 7816,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 6,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "Taichi, we can't do anything else\nhere!",
      "_offset": 7831,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 6,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "Wh...what?!",
      "_offset": 7871,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 7,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "This is bad! The castle's\nbeginning to fall apart!",
      "_offset": 7883,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 7,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "Taichi, we're out of time! Hurry!",
      "_offset": 7934,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 6,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "Ah, okay!",
      "_offset": 7968,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 6,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "Taichi, can I have a moment?",
      "_offset": 7978,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "What's wrong, Koushirou? At a time\nlike this...",
      "_offset": 8007,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "You made a mistake in the cards\nyou chose, so I went ahead and\ncorrected it.",
      "_offset": 8055,
      "_length": 76,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "Gh! Thank you...",
      "_offset": 8132,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 7,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "...Translation complete!",
      "_offset": 8149,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 23,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "\"From the Vaccine-types, present a\nChild form.\"",
      "_offset": 8174,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 24,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "A Child form from the\nVaccine-types! That's...",
      "_offset": 8222,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 7,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "What's wrong...",
      "_offset": 8269,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "There are two cards that work!\nAgumon and Gomamon...",
      "_offset": 8285,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "N-no way...",
      "_offset": 8338,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 7,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "What do we do? Taichi?",
      "_offset": 8350,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "Agumon",
      "_offset": 8377,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "Gomamon",
      "_offset": 8384,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "I can't choose...",
      "_offset": 8392,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "All right! I've decided!",
      "_offset": 8410,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 6,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "It's the Agumon card! Open the\ndoor!",
      "_offset": 8435,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 6,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "All right! I've decided!",
      "_offset": 8472,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
